{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "48d25b77-b682-8426-8387-a43b1df7f901",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T18:04:06-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Miguel Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:02:22-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:02:25-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. I know it's after six and City Hall is closed, but the recording gave me this number, so here I am. Miguel Salazar. I'm at 411 Pelham Street, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:02:36-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Mr. Salazar, that's what this line's for. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:02:40-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The storm drain on the corner is full to the top. Not draining at all. Just a pond of brown water sitting there, and it's been two days since that rain from Friday into Saturday. Two days! Water doesn't take two days to go down a drain that works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:02:55-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not right. Corner of Pelham and which cross street, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:03:00-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one right by my building, the corner just down from my door. I'd tell you the name but I never look at the sign, I just walk it. Anyway, I went out Sunday morning and cleared the leaves off the grate by hand. Wet, nasty, cold leaves. It worked for about ten minutes and then it backed right up again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:03:18-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so something's blocked underneath. Let me write that down. Drain full, not draining, you cleared the grate Sunday, helped about ten minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:03:26-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. So who do I call to get it checked? Because I'm calling you, but I'd like to know somebody's actually going to look at it. This city lets these things sit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:03:37-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You called the right place. I'll put in a work order tonight and the crew will get it in the morning list. I'll take your number in case they need the exact corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:03:48-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one six six. And I only have time to stand out there because I just finished a podcast about the history of bridges. Very good. Better than this drain, I'll tell you that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:04:00-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Got it, Mr. Salazar. Somebody should be out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T18:04:04-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We'll see. Thank you, Kevin."
    }
  ],
